<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: burrow siege-->
  <VFEI_BurrowSiege.label>洞穴获胜</VFEI_BurrowSiege.label>
  <!--EN: Burrow Siege-->
  <VFEI_BurrowSiege.letterLabel>洞穴获胜</VFEI_BurrowSiege.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: A swarm of rare royal insects is tunneling towards you! They will break through in a few seconds and create burrows, that will allow more and more insects to reach the surface. These burrows can only be destroyed using explosives, but they will also collapse after some time.\n\nThe burrows will send insectoids in decreasing intervals until they become too unstable.\n\nThe insects belong to the royal geneline and are significantly harder to kill than their standard counterparts.-->
  <VFEI_BurrowSiege.letterText>一群稀有的皇家昆虫正在向您袭来！它们会在几秒钟内突破并形成洞穴，这将使越来越多的昆虫到达地表。这些洞穴只能用炸药摧毁，但在一段时间后它们也会倒塌。

洞穴会以逐渐减少的间隔发送类昆虫，直到它们变得太不稳定。

这些昆虫属于皇家基因，比标准同类更难杀死。</VFEI_BurrowSiege.letterText>
  <!--EN: horde wave raid-->
  <VFEI_HordeWaveRaid.label>部落浪潮突袭</VFEI_HordeWaveRaid.label>
  <!--EN: infested chunk crash-->
  <VFEI_InfestedChunkCrash.label>受感染的区块崩溃</VFEI_InfestedChunkCrash.label>
  <!--EN: Infested chunk crash-->
  <VFEI_InfestedChunkCrash.letterLabel>受感染的区块崩溃</VFEI_InfestedChunkCrash.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: A number of small chunks of an ancient ship has crashed nearby. \n\nThey seem to be infested with an organic mass. Bizarre insect chittering can be heard within the hull. \n\nDestroy them as soon as possible.-->
  <VFEI_InfestedChunkCrash.letterText>一艘古船的一些小碎片在附近坠毁。 

它们似乎被有机物质侵扰。船体内可以听到奇怪的昆虫叽叽喳喳的声音。 

尽快消灭它们。</VFEI_InfestedChunkCrash.letterText>
  <!--EN: infested module crash-->
  <VFEI_InfestedModuleCrash.label>受感染模块崩溃</VFEI_InfestedModuleCrash.label>
  <!--EN: Infested module crash-->
  <VFEI_InfestedModuleCrash.letterLabel>Infested 模块崩溃</VFEI_InfestedModuleCrash.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: A mysterious segment of a long destroyed spaceship has crashed nearby.\n\nIt seems to be completely covered in biomass and lumps of insectoid jelly. It is fairly certain that this old wreckage may contain ancient dangers.\n\nDestroy it as soon as possible.-->
  <VFEI_InfestedModuleCrash.letterText>一艘长期被毁坏的宇宙飞船的一个神秘部分在附近坠毁。

它似乎完全被生物质和昆虫果冻块覆盖。相当肯定的是，这个古老的残骸可能蕴藏着古老的危险。

尽快摧毁它。</VFEI_InfestedModuleCrash.letterText>
  <!--EN: infested part crash-->
  <VFEI_InfestedPartCrash.label>受感染部件崩溃</VFEI_InfestedPartCrash.label>
  <!--EN: Infested part crash-->
  <VFEI_InfestedPartCrash.letterLabel>受感染部件崩溃</VFEI_InfestedPartCrash.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: A large piece of an ancient ship has crashed nearby.\n\nIt seems to be infested with an organic mass. Bizarre insect chittering can be heard within the hull.\n\nDestroy it as soon as possible.-->
  <VFEI_InfestedPartCrash.letterText>一艘古船的一大块碎片在附近坠毁。

它似乎沾满了有机物。船体内可以听到奇怪的昆虫叽叽喳喳的声音。

尽快摧毁它。</VFEI_InfestedPartCrash.letterText>
  <!--EN: large infestation-->
  <VFEI_LargeInfestation.label>大面积侵扰</VFEI_LargeInfestation.label>
  <!--EN: Large infestation-->
  <VFEI_LargeInfestation.letterLabel>大侵扰</VFEI_LargeInfestation.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: A large swarm of giant insects is tunneling towards you! They will break through in a few seconds and plant hives, as well as other insectoid-built formations.\n\nThe hives will spawn more insects and more hives.\n\nIf you don't want the insects to infest the whole area, destroy the hives. But beware - the bugs will defend their home.-->
  <VFEI_LargeInfestation.letterText>一大群巨型昆虫正在向你袭来！它们将在几秒钟内突破并种植蜂巢以及其他昆虫建造的阵型。

蜂巢将产生更多昆虫和更多蜂巢。

如果您不希望昆虫感染整个区域，请摧毁蜂巢。但要小心——虫子会保卫它们的家园。</VFEI_LargeInfestation.letterText>
  <!--EN: roaming insectoids-->
  <VFEI_RoamingInsectoids.label>漫游类昆虫</VFEI_RoamingInsectoids.label>
  <!--EN: Roaming insectoids-->
  <VFEI_RoamingInsectoids.letterLabel>漫游类昆虫</VFEI_RoamingInsectoids.letterLabel>
  <!--EN: {0} has been ambushed by insectoids from {2}!-->
  <VFEI_RoamingInsectoids.letterText>{0}被来自{2}的昆虫伏击！</VFEI_RoamingInsectoids.letterText>
</LanguageData>
